---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="RecipeShare — Eliana Betancur"
  description="A full-stack recipe sharing application built with Spring Boot. UX redesign in progress."
>
  <div class="px-6 sm:px-10 pt-8 pb-20">
    <article class="w-full page-reveal">

      <p class="font-mono font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-rust-700 mb-5 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-rust-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Project — UX · Full Stack
      </p>

      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.1] mb-6">
        RecipeShare
      </h1>

      <p class="font-sans text-lg sm:text-xl text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed mb-12">
        A full-stack recipe sharing web application built during the PerScholas Full Stack Java Developer certification. UX redesign is planned and in progress.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-16 py-8 border-t border-b border-warmgray-300">
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Role</p>
          <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 font-medium">Solo Developer</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Context</p>
          <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 font-medium">PerScholas Certification</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Status</p>
          <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 font-medium">UX redesign in progress</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Stack</p>
          <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 font-medium">Spring Boot, Java, MySQL</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-warmgray-800 mb-4">What was built</h2>
        <p class="font-sans text-base text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          RecipeShare allows users to register, log in securely, create recipes, and search the database. Built with Java Spring Boot on the backend, the application demonstrates full CRUD functionality, secure authentication, and persistent data storage.
        </p>
        <p class="font-sans text-base text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed">
          The certification focused on backend engineering. The UX was not formally designed — it was built functionally but without a structured design process. That is what I am correcting now.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-warmgray-800 mb-6">What was built</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">User authentication</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">Secure registration and login with session-based access control.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Recipe management</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">Create, view, edit, and delete recipes with persistent database storage.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Search</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">Public search functionality allowing any user to look up recipes in the database.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">RESTful API</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">Clean REST endpoints built with Spring Boot and Hibernate ORM.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-warmgray-800 mb-4">UX redesign — coming soon</h2>
        <p class="font-sans text-base text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The backend is solid. What this project needs is a proper UX layer — user research, flows, wireframes, and a Figma prototype built on Betancur DS components. That work is planned and will be documented here when complete.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Planned UX work</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 mt-1.5 bg-warmgray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              User research and competitive analysis
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 mt-1.5 bg-warmgray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              User flows and information architecture
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 mt-1.5 bg-warmgray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              Wireframes and Figma prototype using Betancur DS
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 mt-1.5 bg-warmgray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              Frontend rebuild with new design applied
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6 mb-16">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/gneliana/RecipeCaseStudy"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-mono text-sm text-rust-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-rust-600 transition-colors"
        >
          View on GitHub →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-0">
        <a href="/" class="font-mono text-sm text-warmgray-500 hover:text-warmgray-800 transition-colors">← Back to home</a>
      </div>

    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-reveal {
    animation: rise 0.6s ease-out both;
  }
  @keyframes rise {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .page-reveal { animation: none; }
  }
</style>